  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  localization: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1f3b411703555425d863c3f14c178acd, type: 2}
  textType: 1
  texts:
  - language: EN
    text: 
  - language: TR
    text: "Annem bir kitap kurduna d\xF6n\xFC\u015Fm\xFC\u015Ft\xFC. Kitab\u0131n
      i\xE7indeydi\ni\u015Fte! Babam bunun fark\u0131nda de\u011Fildi. Onu kurtarmam\u0131z\ngerekiyordu.
      Art\u0131k hep o kitab\u0131n i\xE7inde mi ya\u015Fayacakt\u0131?\nNe yapaca\u011F\u0131m\u0131
      bilmiyordum. Babam\u0131n \u015Fa\u015Fk\u0131nl\u0131\u011F\u0131\ny\xFCz\xFCnden
      okunuyordu."
