  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ce7fc8da2221e434c84814d022392aae, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  localization: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1f3b411703555425d863c3f14c178acd, type: 2}
  textType: 1
  texts:
  - language: EN
    text: 
  - language: TR
    text: "  Elma kurdu, ne zaman elma yemek istesem,\nbir anda elman\u0131n i\xE7inden
      f\u0131rlar. Acaba t\xFCm g\xFCn\norada can\u0131 s\u0131k\u0131lmadan ne yap\u0131yor?
      Arkada\u015Flar\u0131n\u0131,\n  ailesini, evini ya da yata\u011F\u0131n\u0131
      \xF6zlemiyor mu? \n      Ben, annemi ve babam\u0131 hemen \xF6zlerim."
