--- !u!114 &624105097
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 624105093}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ce7fc8da2221e434c84814d022392aae, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  localization: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1f3b411703555425d863c3f14c178acd, type: 2}
  textType: 1
  texts:
  - language: EN
    text: 
  - language: TR
    text: "Babam oturma odas\u0131nda kitap okuyordu. Her yer ne\nkadar da sessizdi.
      Aaa! Elinde tuttu\u011Fu kitaptan sanki bir\nkuyruk sallan\u0131yordu! Hayal
      mi g\xF6r\xFCyordum? Daha net\ng\xF6rebilmek i\xE7in yakla\u015Ft\u0131m. G\xF6zlerimi
      ovu\u015Fturdum."
