  texts:
  - language: EN
    text: 
  - language: TR
    text: "Kitapl\u0131ktaki di\u011Fer kitaplara bakt\u0131m. Daha \xF6nce kitaplara\nhi\xE7
      bu kadar yakla\u015Fmam\u0131\u015Ft\u0131m. Rastgele se\xE7tiklerimi\nincelemeye
      ba\u015Flad\u0131m. Ger\xE7ekten de babam hakl\u0131ym\u0131\u015F!"
