--- !u!114 &1630635067
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1630635063}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ce7fc8da2221e434c84814d022392aae, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  localization: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1f3b411703555425d863c3f14c178acd, type: 2}
  textType: 1
  texts:
  - language: EN
    text: 
  - language: TR
    text: "  Annem kitaplar\u0131 ve k\xFCt\xFCphaneleri \xE7ok sever. Beni de\nyan\u0131nda
      g\xF6t\xFCrmekten hi\xE7 vazge\xE7mez. O g\xFCn de birlikte\n   k\xFCt\xFCphaneye
      gittik. Bu sefer fikrimin de\u011Fi\u015Fece\u011Fini\n   d\xFC\u015F\xFCn\xFCyordu.
      Kahvalt\u0131m\u0131 bitirmek istemedim. Ne\n  kadar ge\xE7 kal\u0131rsak o
      kadar iyi. Zaman kazanmak i\xE7in\nelimden geleni yapt\u0131m. Yere re\xE7el
      d\xF6kt\xFCm. S\xFCp\xFCrgenin\n  i\xE7inde biriken t\xFCyleri "
